 /// Interface owning the lowest-metric IPv4 default route.
+///
+/// [honk-android] Android puts default routes in per-network policy tables
+/// (e.g. table 1021 for rmnet_data2, table 1029 for wlan0) while the main
+/// table (`/proc/net/route`) has no 0.0.0.0/0 entry. When `/proc/net/route`
+/// has no default route, probe the kernel routing policy via a connected
+/// UDP socket + `getsockname()` + `getifaddrs()`.
